        "fq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is this?",
            "a": "<p>This is a <strong>silent vibrating wrist alarm</strong> designed to wake you up without noise, stress, or disturbing anyone around you.</p><p>Instead of loud, jarring sounds, it uses <strong>gentle but effective vibrations on your wrist</strong> to wake you naturally, making mornings smoother, calmer, and more controlled.</p><p>Perfect for:</p><ul><li>Light sleepers who hate harsh alarms<br/></li><li>Deep sleepers who need a stronger physical cue<br/></li><li>Couples who don’t want to wake each other<br/></li><li>Anyone trying to start their day without chaos</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "fq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will this actually wake me?",
            "a": "<p>Designed specifically for heavy sleepers, but with a smarter approach to waking you up. </p><p>Instead of a fixed vibration, the alarm <strong>gradually increases in intensity</strong><br/> until you wake, making it ideal if you’ve struggled to wake up your <br/>entire life, sleep through multiple alarms, or hit snooze without <br/>realizing.</p><p>Because it vibrates <strong>directly on your wrist</strong>, your brain can’t ignore it like sound. And every order is backed by our <strong>100% Wake-Up Guarantee. <br/><br/> If it doesn’t wake you up, you don’t pay.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "fq3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How it works?",
            "a": "<p><strong>Somna</strong> wakes you with powerful, silent vibrations directly on your wrist. <br/><br/>Simply set your wake-up time, wear the band, and it activates when it’s time to get up. <br/><br/>For a full walkthrough, visit our <a href=\"https://histrips.com/pages/onyx-sleep-wrist-alarm-instructions\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Onyx Sleep Wrist Alarm Instructions\"><strong>How It Works</strong> </a>page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fq4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Who is this perfect for?",
            "a": "<p><strong>1. </strong>Deep sleepers who don’t respond to traditional sound alarms<br/><br/><strong>2. </strong>People who frequently oversleep or unconsciously hit snooze<br/><br/><strong>3. </strong>Couples who want to wake up without disturbing their partner<br/><br/><strong>4. </strong>Individuals with ADHD who find mornings especially difficult<br/><br/><strong>5. </strong>People with narcolepsy who benefit from a dependable vibration alert<br/><br/><strong>6. </strong>Hearing-impaired sleepers who need a silent and reliable way to wake up</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4XLTLi": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "I always sleep through alarm clocks. Will this wake me up?",
            "a": "<p><strong>Yes.</strong> Vibration, especially directly on the wrist is far more effective at stimulating the brain than sound alone. <br/><br/>The Somna alarm is designed specifically for heavy sleepers who struggle <br/>with traditional alarms or wake-up lights. Its vibration gradually <br/>increases in intensity until you wake up, even from deep sleep. <br/><br/><strong>Tested by over +10,000 heavy sleepers</strong>, 99% reported waking up on time during a 100-day trial. <br/><br/>For many, it’s the solution that finally fixed their mornings.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Y37pkr": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Shipping and Returns",
            "a": "<p>We ship fast, worldwide.</p><ul><li><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €45 | $50</li><li>Processing time: <strong>1 business day</strong></li><li>Delivery: <strong>3-7 business days</strong></li><li>Tracking provided on <strong>all</strong> orders</li><li>Ships from local EU warehouses for speed & reliability</li></ul><p><em>See our </em><a href=\"https://histrips.com/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\"><em>return policy</em></a><em> for more information.</em></p><p>You'll get an email with tracking info as soon as your order leaves the building. Fast, reliable, and ready when you are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_9hniiK": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Frequently asked questions",
            "a": "<p><strong>How long does the battery last?</strong> Up to 14 days on a single charge with normal nightly use.</p><p><strong>Is it loud enough to wake me?</strong> The vibration is calibrated to wake you without sound. Heavy sleepers can set repeat vibration intervals.</p><p><strong>Does it need a phone or app?</strong> No. Somna is a standalone device, set the alarm directly on the band.</p><p><strong>Can I shower with it?</strong> It's water-resistant for daily use but not designed for swimming or showering.</p>"
          }
        },
